  "slug": "fur-eh",
  "name": "Fur-Eh!",
  "shortName": null,
  "description": "Held each year in Edmonton, Fur-Eh! has grown from 200 attendees at its May 2012 debut to 2,497 in 2026. The non-profit Canadian Anthropomorphics Inc. organises it. Planning began in 2010, led by Thallanor Rasmuson with Fallout Coyote, and it became the first furry convention in Alberta. Its dates later shifted to June (2017) and then to July (2022). After using several Edmonton hotels, it made the Wyndham Edmonton Hotel and Conference Centre its home in 2024. The 2020 and 2021 editions were cancelled.",
